sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant H as AI Host
 participant C as MCP Client
 participant S as MCP Server
 participant G as Domain Tool Gateway
 U->>H: Request task
 H->>C: Provide task + trusted user context
 opt Optional discovery
  C->>S: server/discover + request _meta
  S-->>C: versions + capabilities + serverInfo
 end
 C->>S: tools/list + per-request _meta + Mcp-Method
 S-->>C: tools + input schemas + ttlMs + cacheScope
 H->>H: Check consent + scopes + tenant policy
 C->>S: tools/call + _meta + Mcp-Method + Mcp-Name
 S->>G: Validate schema + invoke scoped domain handler
 G-->>S: Result
 S-->>C: resultType + content + serverInfo metadata
 C-->>H: Untrusted tool content
 H->>H: Validate and sanitize result
